+# Third-party code
+
+## PCSX2 IPU core
+
+The files under `ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ipu/` are ported from the PCSX2 IPU
+(MPEG decoder) core, upstream revision `81526d4`
+(https://github.com/PCSX2/pcsx2).
+
+Ported from PCSX2 (https://github.com/PCSX2/pcsx2). License:
+GPL-3.0+ (`SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0+`,
+`SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2002-2026 PCSX2 Dev Team`, preserved verbatim in each
+file). PS2Recomp is GPL-3; the combined work is distributed under GPL-3.0+.
+
+Vendored files (upstream -> local):
+
+| upstream (pcsx2/IPU/) | local (ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ipu/) | notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| IPU.h, IPU.cpp | IPU.h, IPU.cpp | register file + command dispatch; SaveStateBase/ReportIPU stripped, `ipuRegs` is a plain global (upstream aliases `eeHw[0x2000]`) |
+| IPU_MultiISA.h, IPU_MultiISA.cpp | IPU_MultiISA.h, IPU_MultiISA.cpp | decoder core; MULTI_ISA machinery compiled once (x86-64 SSE2/scalar) |
+| mpeg2_vlc.h | mpeg2_vlc.h | unchanged (also contains libmpeg2-derived VLC constants, GPL; see header) |
+| IPU_Fifo.h, IPU_Fifo.cpp | IPU_Fifo.h, IPU_Fifo.cpp | in/out FIFOs |
+| IPUdma.h, IPUdma.cpp | IPUdma.h, IPUdma.cpp | status structs + DMA register views; the scheduler-driven ch3/ch4 engines are reimplemented in `ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_ipu.cpp` (synchronous execution model) |
+| yuv2rgb.h, yuv2rgb.cpp | yuv2rgb.h, yuv2rgb.cpp | SSE2 + reference paths |
+| IPUdither.cpp | IPUdither.cpp | reference path (upstream SSE path is behind an MSVC-only macro) |
+
+Host glue (not derived from PCSX2 code, GPL-3.0+ like the rest of PS2Recomp):
+`ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ipu/ipu_compat.h` (types/macros shims),
+`ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_ipu.{h,cpp}` (adapter), and the wiring in
+`ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_memory.cpp`.
